[{:db/id "q-23188/answer/b1593b1e5d4a41639df09fccf382c84820e7842e9b833a0d4c42380e62cb10c9" :answer/id #uuid "47ceb83f-6cc8-58ef-aa1a-c18c5da82874" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{145}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23188/answer" :answer-field/id #uuid "a70725e6-912d-57c9-923b-d73aea67ddd7" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-23188/answer/b1593b1e5d4a41639df09fccf382c84820e7842e9b833a0d4c42380e62cb10c9" :answer-field/choices ["q-23188/answer/b1593b1e5d4a41639df09fccf382c84820e7842e9b833a0d4c42380e62cb10c9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-23188" :question/id #uuid "13000a10-55bd-5f4c-8290-3040e5cc82c7" :question/math-academy-id "q-23188" :question/problem "What angles are coterminal with $\\theta ={145}^{∘}?$\n\nI. - ${155}^{∘}$\nII. - ${505}^{∘}$\nIII. - $-{575}^{∘}$\n\nAnswer: {{answer}}" :question/worked-solution "To find the coterminal angles of a given angle $\\theta $, we add and subtract integer multiples of ${360}^{∘}:$\n\nLet's start by adding multiples of ${360}^{∘}$ to ${145}^{∘}$:\n\n- ${145}^{∘}+{360}^{∘}={505}^{∘}\\,✓$\n\nOf the given values, there is no angle greater than ${505}^{∘}.$ So we can stop there.\n\nNow, let's subtract multiples of ${360}^{∘}$ from ${145}^{∘}$\n\n- ${145}^{∘}-{360}^{∘}=-{215}^{∘}$\n\n- ${145}^{∘}-2\\cdot {360}^{∘}=-{575}^{∘}\\,✓$\n\nOf the given angles, only ${505}^{∘}$ and $-{575}^{∘}$ are coterminal with ${145}^{∘}.$\n\nSo the correct answer is II and III only." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-23188/answer"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "bba0ad98-6940-502a-873c-8a589a03a499"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-23188"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
